d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀枝上小鹊","author":"陈献章","text":"翠裙白领眼中无，飞上木犀还一呼。\n乾坤未可轻微物，自在天机我不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠周成","author":"陈献章","text":"虚无里面昭昭应，影响前头步步迷。\n说到鸢飞鱼跃处，绝无人力有天机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春中杂兴 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"春寒著莫絮袍轻，游走何山更乞晴。\n夜梦髯翁作人拜，安知不是白龙精。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春中杂兴 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"香烟袅入袖中蛇，读易山斋日未斜。\n领取乾坤分付意，扶留生耳木犀花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳后一日里人送角黍酒至","author":"陈献章","text":"荷瓢童子问谁家，老妇檐前驻纺车。\n角黍唤回端午梦，还从艾盏得松花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日木犀未开 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"野径香沉舞蝶稀，柴门树老著花迟。\n含章此日无穷意，只有阶前拄杖知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日木犀未开 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"菊来栗里何须酒，梅到孤山不欠诗。\n老去未甘诗酒废，木犀其那放花迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀花下待陈秉常","author":"陈献章","text":"常疑楚客餐秋菊，不信唐人醉牡丹。\n何处木犀香可爱，须君曾到玉台山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢九江惠菊 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"谁将此菊种江滨，物色当年漉酒巾。\n若道渊明今我是，清香还属隔江人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢九江惠菊 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"紫菊移来紫水滨，白头对著白纶巾。\n花前酌酒笑未足，酒后簪花笑杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢九江惠菊 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"故根迢递九江滨，岁晚相看此道巾。\n不用诗流强分别，种花人是赏花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢九江惠菊 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"鹤袖披翻野水滨，黄花簪破小乌巾。\n腰间我有坡翁带，解与西邻卖酒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜梦见太母急呼诸孙前拜","author":"陈献章","text":"欲觉未觉梦中梦，有形无形身外身。\n喜逐悲来呼不得，曾孙前拜太夫人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马肇文惠油酒并录示哭一峰先生诗及送林缉熙掌教绝句复以香一束赋三绝见意 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"谁以三年报一峰，舒刚盖有古人风。\n一词亦到君亲地，何处无人覆马龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马肇文惠油酒并录示哭一峰先生诗及送林缉熙掌教绝句复以香一束赋三绝见意 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"清油浊酒慰家贫，老子山中但白云。\n君欲看云须久坐，晴窗端为起炉熏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马肇文惠油酒并录示哭一峰先生诗及送林缉熙掌教绝句复以香一束赋三绝见意 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"南川钓艇已横波，里水渔翁又放歌。\n今日未知明日事，且倾君酒为君哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]